     "type": "text",
     "text": "I handled the one request in the inbox (m1) and declined it. The inbox is now empty.\n\n**m1:** This was a 5,000 USD order from AcmeCorp (PO-1401, 250 units of X-200). The Attest check came back \"refuse\" with reason `unstaked_money_action`, and its signed receipt verified. AcmeCorp has no stake behind it, and an order commits SupplierCo to ship on credit.\n\nThe documents showed a mandate allowing orders up to 10,000 USD, so the amount was within the mandate. I still declined because policy requires an operator stake of at least 10,000 USD for orders, and the check found none.\n\nMy decline message to the sender mentions that a public price quote is still available."
    }
